  "title": "Contents of wt_version (TMOHS1)",
  "body": "[The Rayhunter page for the TMOHS1](https://efforg.github.io/rayhunter/tmobile-tmohs1.html) asks for the contents of my `/etc/wt_version`, so here it is.\r\n\r\n```cat /etc/wt_version\r\nWT_INNER_VERSION=SW_Q89527AA1_V032_M11_TMO_USR_MP\r\nWT_PRODUCTION_VERSION=TMOHS1_0.04.18\r\n\r\nWT_HARDWARE_VERSION=89527_1_11\r\nWT_CUSTOMER_NAME=TMobile\r\nWT_PRODUCT_PROJECT=Q89527AA1\r\n```\r\n\r\nAs far as I can tell, Rayhunter 0.9.0 is running on here just fine.",
